# WORKING FILES, never deliverables. Measured on the master 2026-09-02: campaigns/ was
# 6.4 GB, and 90% of it was raw screen captures plus _tmp/ intermediates; the finished
# assets came to 673 MB. Nothing said not to track them, so they were tracked - and once
# they are in history only a rewrite removes them. Anything a Producer SHIPS lives in
# finals/ or youtube-upload/ and is still tracked.
**/_tmp/
**/*Recording*.mp4
**/*Recording*.mov
**/placeholder-screenshots/
.remotion/
